{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["And he said — to the angel speaking in me, even though he did not mention it, for he followed a concise path." "And the meaning of כפי איש (according to each man) — upon the children of Judah, each according to his station." "לא נשא ראשו (he has not lifted his head) — not one of them, against these horns." "ובאו אלה (and these shall come) — the men." "לידות את הקרנות (to throw the horns) — to cast them from their place, like ידו גורל (he cast a lot). And so the meaning: that all the adversaries shall depart and the House shall be built."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:45:44.855575640Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}